WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:06,580
Dad made this for the fish

2
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:08,980
Mom, you have to eat it all for me

3
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:10,580
I'm your mother

4
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:26,750
What's wrong with eating two pieces of your flesh, little brother?

5
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,990
I'm looking for your boss. Is he here?

6
00:00:29,990 --> 00:00:34,770
Someone is looking for you, Brother Hai

7
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:36,690
Why are you here Xiaolin?

8
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:39,170
I heard that your business has suddenly improved recently.

9
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,460
Not bad, not bad

10
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:42,180
I knew you could do it
